## APPENDIX: TECHNICAL DEEP DIVES

### For Technical Audiences
If your audience is technical, you can dive deeper into:
- Kubernetes federation and workload scheduling
- Istio service mesh configuration and traffic management
- gRPC for service-to-service communication
- Event-driven architecture with Kafka
- Distributed tracing and observability
- Multi-region replication strategies
- Disaster recovery and RTO/RPO

### For Business Audiences
If your audience is business-focused, emphasize:
- Cost savings and ROI
- Time to market acceleration
- Reduced operational overhead
- Competitive advantages
- Customer success stories
- Pricing and licensing models
- Support and professional services

### For Executive Audiences
If your audience is executive-level, focus on:
- Strategic advantages
- Market opportunity
- Competitive positioning
- Revenue potential
- Risk mitigation
- Customer testimonials
- Vision and roadmap

